TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey! O elindeki ne?
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Tam da böyle bir şeyi her yerde arıyordum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Seninkini bana verir misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bedavaya değil tabii! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Karşılığında benim
{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}} veririm.{{TAG:0008:0005:0500150004002800}}
Tamam, takas!
Yok, sağ ol.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dis, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, j'ai un machin là qui
semble avoir été inventé pour toi...
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
T'en as rêvé toute ta vie, avoue !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Mais pas si vite !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} En échange, je
veux {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} !{{TAG:0008:0005:0B0015000A002800}}
Waouh, c'est inespéré !
L'espoir fait vivre...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bende tam senlik bir şey var, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Üstünde resmen adın yazıyor.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Evet, benim {{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
İstersin, değil mi? Bence kesin istersin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Ama bir şartla. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Sen de bana {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} vereceksin!{{TAG:0008:0005:0B0015000A002800}}
Vay, tamam!
Asla.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Oh, fine.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} My poems are terrible,
and I can't trade to save my life.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Well, I'll just be over here. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Moping.{{TAG:000B:0003:01CD}}

