aquí me quedo todo triste.{{TAG:000B:0003:01CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Oh, certo.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Le mie poesie sono
